OL,3,GNEWSABinned battery led to recycling
OL,4,Acentre blaze
OL,5,
OL,6,FA fire at a recycling centre which took
OL,7,Fdays to bring under control was started
OL,8,Fby a discarded battery, investigators
OL,9,Fhave said.
OL,11,FDerbyshire Fire and Rescue Service was
OL,12,Fcalled at about 20:00 BST on Saturday 5
OL,13,FSeptember to a fire off Staveley Lane,
OL,14,FEckington.
OL,16,FCrews from Alfreton, Clay Cross, Clowne
OL,17,Fand Staveley fought the blaze through a
OL,18,F"challenging" night, and had to then
OL,19,Freturn to the site "on several
OL,20,Foccasions" to stop hotspots from
OL,21,Fflaring up.
OL,23,APub: 12-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
